==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|is|far|miði|t1=passage, ride|t2=note, ticket}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈfar.mɪːðɪ/}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# transportation [[ticket]]; a pass entitling the holder to board a train, a bus, a plane, or other means of transportation.
#: {{syn|is|farseðill|miði}}

